        "subject": "LU-20221 lnet: allocate proper size sk buffer for NIs",
        "message": "LU-20221 lnet: allocate proper size sk buffer for NIs\n\nThe default sk buffer for collecting NIs Netlink information is\nonly 16Kb nby default. This limits the number of NI's so lets\ncalculate the required size for the sk buffer to avoid this\nlimitation.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nChange-Id: Ie2801d4dd09681367f430c32a369f1b64b751244\nSigned-off-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\n"
      },
